# Banner Image Placeholder
# This should be a 493x58 pixel bitmap (.bmp) file
# Shows at the top of installer dialogs
# Should contain your company logo and product branding
# Use your CBWSS-Logo.png as reference for design
# 
# To create:
# 1. Open your CBWSS-Logo.png in image editor
# 2. Resize to 493x58 pixels
# 3. Add text "CBWSS-Sync Installer" if desired
# 4. Save as Banner.bmp in this folder